// Windows resource file for NetProbe.exe.
//
// Resource ID 1 ICON is the convention Explorer uses to pick the executable's
// primary icon (shown in File Explorer, taskbar, and shortcuts). The .ico file
// referenced below should be a multi-resolution icon (typical sizes: 16x16,
// 32x32, 48x48, 256x256) so Windows can pick the right one for each context.
//
// The CMake build only compiles this resource when resources/netprobe.ico
// exists, so dropping in an icon and rebuilding is all that's needed.
1 ICON "netprobe.ico"
